    "revision": "A",
    "notes": "Three yarns, three toolpaths: the program stops to change yarn before the blue and the grey. It is posted mirrored, because a rug is tufted from its back - the front reads HELLO. Stitch speed 1200 mm/min and 4 mm rows are starting points; set the needle Z and gun angles in Machine Settings."
